WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.554
Before we build your final plan, I want

2
00:00:02.554 --> 00:00:04.458
you to watch for a few traps.

3
00:00:04.458 --> 00:00:06.618
Some job- search habits feel productive

4
00:00:06.618 --> 00:00:08.916
but actually slow you down.

5
00:00:08.916 --> 00:00:11.389
Applying everywhere without a strategy.

6
00:00:11.389 --> 00:00:12.968
Hiding from your network.

7
00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:15.987
Spending forever trying to perfect your résumé.

8
00:00:15.987 --> 00:00:17.577
Losing your routine.

9
00:00:17.577 --> 00:00:19.783
Trying to do everything alone.

10
00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.045
I'm going to give you a few situations.

11
00:00:23.045 --> 00:00:24.938
You tell me what you would change.
